                                                        '\n'
                                                        '    movieTP + movieDM + movieBD + horror01 + horror02\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        'for each DMN BA group defined in shen268.csv, using the '
                                                        'same:\n'
                                                        '- Stage-1 dyad-specific temporal slopes\n'
                                                        '- dataset/session fixed effects\n'
                                                        '- crossed-participant random effects\n'
                                                        '- repeated-dyad random intercepts\n'
                                                        '- equal-weight fixed-effect contrast across the five observed '
                                                        'datasets/sessions\n'
                                                        '- neural+behavior participant bootstrap\n'
                                                        '- ACF-informed intact-block temporal permutation\n'
                                                        '- independent cross-study bootstrap pairing\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        'as the existing V5 pipeline.\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        'This script is intended to be placed BESIDE:\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        '1) '
                                                        'Chen_style_allWindow_DMN_regional_BA_ALLFIVE_DIRECT_BEHAVIOR_V5_NEURAL_SAMPLING.py\n'
                                                        '2) Study1_DMN_independent_modalities.py\n'
                                                        '3) Study2_DMN_matched_modalities.py\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        'It reuses the already-created whole-DMN behavioral-bootstrap '
                                                        'residual memmaps and\n'
                                                        'temporal permutation plans when they exist. Regional pairwise '
                                                        'caches are also\n'
                                                        'reused when available.\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        'Primary FDR family\n'
                                                        '------------------\n'
                                                        'The inferential family is the set of pooled all-five '
                                                        'marginal-valence effects\n'
                                                        'across all DMN BA regions. BH-FDR is therefore applied across '
                                                        'the regional\n'
                                                        'pooled effects only (normally 10 tests).\n'
                                                        '\n'
                                                        'Outputs\n'
                                                        '-------\n'
                                                        '<RESULTS_DIR>/slidingWindow_isc/\n'
                                                        '  '
                                                        'Chen_style_two_stage_ALLFIVE_NEURAL_BEHAVIOR_SAMPLING_20260807_V5/\n'
